        "en": "The label has conditions, age limits or notes for children; the label sentence is quoted below."
      },
      "quote": "Naloxone hydrochloride injection, USP may be administered intravenously, intramuscularly or subcutaneously in children and neonates to reverse the effects of opiates.",
